{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>How you have broken through!</b> Like a person who breaks a vow and departs from it — behold, upon you rests the claim of this breach. Others said it is like ופרצת (Genesis 28:14). The Gaon [Saadia] said that מה פרצת is as its literal meaning, only upon you is פרץ from the decree of ויפרץ לרב (Genesis 30:30)."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:28.054345823Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}